---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Notice for Personal Data" description="How we process your personal data as a member or contact.">

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Notice for<br>Personal Data</h1>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 16px;">Foundation Health Finland Oy · Last updated: 14.12.2025</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-ivory">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal-body fade-up">
        <a href="/legal/privacy-policy" class="legal-back">← Back to privacy policy</a>

        <h2>1. Data Controller</h2>
        <p>Foundation Health Finland Oy and independent practitioners operating within its units. Foundation serves as the primary contact point for data subjects in matters related to the exercise of data-subject rights.</p>

        <h2>2. Purposes of Processing and Legal Bases</h2>
        <p>The primary personal data processed is healthcare customer data. Patient data are processed principally for the provision, organisation, planning, monitoring, and delivery of care. Customer data not relating to health information are processed for managing the customer relationship, customer service, and service development.</p>

        <h2>3. Retention Periods</h2>
        <p>Patient data are retained for at least 12 years after the patient's death or 120 years from the patient's birth. Customer data other than patient data are retained for as long as the customer relationship exists.</p>

        <h2>4. Security and Location of Processing</h2>
        <p>Foundation uses a wide range of organisational and technical measures to ensure the security of personal data processing, including access management, strong authentication, and modern encryption technologies. We primarily process personal data within the EU/EEA.</p>

        <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to access your data, request rectification, request erasure where applicable, object to or restrict processing, and lodge a complaint with the Data Protection Ombudsman.</p>
        <p>To exercise these rights, contact Foundation's Data Protection Officer at <a href="mailto:privacy@foundation.clinic">privacy@foundation.clinic</a>.</p>

        <h2>6. Contact Details</h2>
        <p>Data Protection Officer: Fredrik Sannholm<br><a href="mailto:privacy@foundation.clinic">privacy@foundation.clinic</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>